    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Trust in God Concerning the Treachery of Friends"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "To the Chief Musician. With stringed instruments. A Contemplation of David."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Give ear to my prayer, O God,",
          "And do not hide Yourself from my supplication."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Attend to me, and hear me;",
          "I am restless in my complaint, and moan noisily,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Because of the voice of the enemy,",
          "Because of the oppression of the wicked;",
          "For they bring down trouble upon me,",
          "And in wrath they hate me."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "My heart is severely pained within me,",
          "And the terrors of death have fallen upon me."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Fearfulness and trembling have come upon me,",
          "And horror has overwhelmed me."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "So I said, “Oh, that I had wings like a dove!",
          "I would fly away and be at rest."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Indeed, I would wander far off,",
          "And remain in the wilderness."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Selah"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I would hasten my escape",
          "From the windy storm and tempest.”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Destroy, O Lord, and divide their tongues,",
          "For I have seen violence and strife in the city."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Day and night they go around it on its walls;",
          "Iniquity and trouble are also in the midst of it."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Destruction is in its midst;",
          "Oppression and deceit do not depart from its streets."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For it is not an enemy who reproaches me;",
          "Then I could bear it.",
          "Nor is it one who hates me who has exalted himself against me;",
          "Then I could hide from him."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "But it was you, a man my equal,",
          "My companion and my acquaintance."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "We took sweet counsel together,",
          "And walked to the house of God in the throng."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Let death seize them;",
          "Let them go down alive into hell,",
          "For wickedness is in their dwellings and among them."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "As for me, I will call upon God,",
          "And the Lord shall save me."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Evening and morning and at noon",
          "I will pray, and cry aloud,",
          "And He shall hear my voice."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          18
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He has redeemed my soul in peace from the battle that was against me,",
          "For there were many against me."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          19
        ],
        "lines": [
          "God will hear, and afflict them,",
          "Even He who abides from of old."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Selah"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          19
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Because they do not change,",
          "Therefore they do not fear God."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          20
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He has put forth his hands against those who were at peace with him;",
          "He has broken his covenant."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          21
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The words of his mouth were smoother than butter,",
          "But war was in his heart;",
          "His words were softer than oil,",
          "Yet they were drawn swords."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          22
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Cast your burden on the Lord,",
          "And He shall sustain you;",
          "He shall never permit the righteous to be moved."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          23
        ],
        "lines": [
          "But You, O God, shall bring them down to the pit of destruction;",
          "Bloodthirsty and deceitful men shall not live out half their days;",
          "But I will trust in You."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
